# Location Tracker App

**Course:** Final Software Development Project  
**Institution:** University of the Cumberlands  
**Technology:** C#, .NET MAUI, SQLite, Maps

## Project Overview
This project is designed to demonstrate a multiplatform location tracking application. The intended features include requesting foreground location permission, saving location coordinates and timestamps to a local SQLite database, and displaying saved locations on a map.

## Current Status
The project design and sample C# code are documented in the accompanying assignment report. The complete application build and heat-map functionality still need to be implemented and tested.

## Technologies
- C#
- .NET MAUI
- SQLite
- .NET MAUI Maps
